			<div class="content" id="post-content-3634775">
									

<p>So this is like a reality-bending system of mathematics? An interesting idea, if not a little overdone.<br />
However, there are many errors throughout your scip, mostly tonal errors.</p>
<p>Here's a quick few I picked up on-</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>every sapient person that entered</p>
</blockquote>
<p>&quot;sapient&quot; seems rather redundant here</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-3669 is a book teaching the reader</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You just stated that it was a book at the beginning of the previous paragraph</p>
<blockquote>
<p>more simply</p>
</blockquote>
<p>should be substituted for something such as &quot;more effectively/efficiently&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>based around arrows pointing in 1 of 8 directions</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'm not really sure what this means, and this in turn led the testing logs (and the entire SCP, really) to be rather confusing. More elaboration on how the system works would be nice.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-3669-2 exclusively uses arrows until the solution, which is rendered numerically.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This sentence needs to be worded better. I suggest something along the lines of &quot;SCP-3669-2 uses arrows exclusively to reach a numerical solution.&quot;</p>
<p>Also, there's a lot missing from your description that's covered in your logs. I recommend you cover more of the anomalous effects, primarily those outlined in your incident log and the effects and significance of SCP-3669-3.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Please collapse long posts. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>-1 for now, until it's cleaned up and explained further.</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Edit: I'm not a mod, but you're not allowed to vote on your own article. I advise you to rescind your vote before a mod notices.</span> WHoops yeah I'm old</p>

